{"id":1020903,"name":"シニックス·取り調べⅢ","type":"trial","scenes":[{"id":1,"name":"シニックス·取り調べⅢ","code_name":"","dialogue_ids":[1020903]}],"trial":{"trial_id":20903,"stage":"段階3","unlock_time":"2025-11-08 05:00:00","diary1":"シニックスは気ままな自由さを追い求め、灰の使徒と奔放な戦いを繰り広げ、莫大なアダマントを吸収して力を増していた。背後に潜む危険を一切顧みることなく——","diary2":"灰の使徒との死闘の中でシニックスは制御不能に陥った。窮地の中、あなたは彼女が弱った隙を突き、強引に枷をかける。\n　意外なことに、枷は彼女の体内で暴走する狂瞳とアダマントを制御し、彼女を再び正気へと戻した。そして彼女は、この尋常ならざる新たな力に興奮を覚えたのだった！\n　あなたたちの連携攻撃によって灰の使徒は大打撃を受け、最終的に逃走した。しかしあなたたちも力尽きて倒れてしまう。ほどなくして、発信機の信号を追ってきたFACに発見された。","evidence":[{"ID":260799,"Num":1}],"usable_items":[{"ID":260800,"Num":1}],"reward":[{"ID":240001,"Num":50}],"obey_award":100,"qte_failure":0,"failure_step":0,"graph":[{"step":1,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120903001,"next":null},{"step":2,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120903002,"next":null},{"step":3,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120903003,"next":null},{"step":4,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120903004,"next":null},{"step":5,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120903005,"next":null},{"step":6,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120903006,"next":null},{"step":7,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120903007,"next":null},{"step":8,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120903008,"next":null},{"step":9,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120903009,"next":null},{"step":10,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120903010,"next":null},{"step":11,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120903011,"next":null},{"step":12,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120903012,"next":null},{"step":13,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120903013,"next":null},{"step":14,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120903014,"next":null},{"step":15,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120903015,"next":null},{"step":16,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120903016,"next":null},{"step":17,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120903017,"next":null},{"step":18,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120903018,"next":null},{"step":19,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120903019,"next":null},{"step":20,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120903020,"next":null},{"step":21,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120903021,"next":null},{"step":22,"course":2,"dialogue_id":120903022,"next":null},{"step":23,"cours